ize.Mode.solve\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">BVDecide</span>.<span class=\"name\">Normalize</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mode</span>.<span class=\"name\">solve</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">restrictedTypes</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Mode\">Mode</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A regular run as part of `bv_decide` or a standalone `bv_normalize`. `restrictedTypes` are the\ntypes that the structure and enum analysis is restricted to, as provided by the `types` clause.\nIf this is `none` the analysis discovers the relevant types on its own.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Mode.solve","kind":"ctor","line":105,"name":"Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Mode.solve","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Basic.lean#L105-L110"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/BVDecide/Normalize/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.Tactic.BVDecide.Normalize.Mode\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">BVDecide</span>.<span class=\"name\">Normalize</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mode</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The mode that the `b